& [ObservedLocalSurface]
  + one local-only Ollama process listens at 127.0.0.1:11434
  + its OpenAI-compatible v1 models endpoint advertises five models
  + its root endpoint reports healthy while its health path returns not found
  + no EVO-X2 or remote connection is needed for this observation

& [UsabilityNeed]
  + permit the operator to select exactly one model identity from the advertised set
  + retain fail-closed auto-selection when no model is specified and the set is not singular
  + accept a successful local provider root health response without requiring a llama.cpp-specific health path
  + emit one explicitly experimental deterministic CoordinationToolContext fixture for local end-to-end testing
  + mark the fixture as test evidence rather than signed SOP authority or general user data

& [Boundary]
  + model selection must match one exact advertised identifier
  + fixture export is create-new and effectless except for the named local output file
  + neither capability discovers contacts or falls back to a remote host
